WEBVTT

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:46.960
Just because His Holiness says that
they are abiding by the taboo...

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:51.760
My Crown has been repainted in Army colors!

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:00.560
The Capital Army are obviously
violating the taboo!

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:13.190
Protect the world, Capital Army!

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.650
Protect it with your new machines!

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:17.860
Elf Bullock!

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.660
That's an Elf Bullock.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:29.310
Were we ordered to withdraw because
these were officially put into use?

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.880
This is the first in a line of mass-production
machines based on your Elf Bull data.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.760
A nice piece of work, huh?

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.310
- Look at that mask!
- ﻿He's so cool!

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:46.480
- He's not bad.
- He's totally my type

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.020
Lame.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.900
Thank you for seeing me off before I sortie.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.230
We have high hopes for you.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.400
What is that mask for?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.070
It works as a monitor.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.160
It helps with some operations too.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.370
It's a test model based on some files
we got from the Research Department.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:07.660
Luin wasn't with the
Capital Guard today either.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.380
Colonel, you have those materials
from the previous era,

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.050
the Rose of Hermes Blueprints...

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.470
If you are asking me to violate the taboo,

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.510
I will require many times the
staff and resources I have now.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:29.690
Which is precisely why I will insist you
stop taking people from the Capital Guard.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:33.980
But the Army is working so
hard to rescue your son.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.000
Hey, could you tell me something?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:56.050
What's this threat from outer space
that Lieutenant Klim mentioned?

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.010
Have you not asked him?

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:01.720
He said he'd tell me if I
joined the Pirate Corps.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.350
- Then join.
- ﻿I can't do that!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.560
Resupply ships come here.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.440
and they have new Mobile Suit models...

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:15.150
- Look, a friend.
- ﻿Yo!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.150
See?

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.650
They're a military unit,
no matter how I look at it.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.780
Klim, you believe the son of the
Operations Director of Capital Tower

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.290
when he says he knows nothing of Towasanga?

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:33.250
Surely, the students in the Capital Guard
think of little but their schedules.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:38.590
Towasanga is the holy land of the SU-Cordists,
who bring us Photon Batteries.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.510
It's a sacred place, right?

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.090
You believe that?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:47.720
What would you think if I said the G-Self
was manufactured in Towasanga?

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.480
Towasanga?

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:53.230
Towa...? Towa! Towa! Towa!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.980
Towa! Towa! Towasanga!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.650
Chuchumy.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.570
You sure do like that fish, Raraiya.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.780
Chuchumy.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.240
Are you sure the G-Self was built there?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:07.280
Captain Donyell has suggested
this girl may be able to tell us.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.620
Hey.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.370
Wow.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:18.090
Lieutenant, I need you to sign for these.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:20.760
Fine work, Mick Jack.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.090
I see you brought yet
another new model today.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:24.590
The Hecate.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:28.220
It handles better than you
might think by looking at it.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.180
Well, I'm off to my next stop!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.640
When I say you can't, you can't.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.900
As of this moment, this ship will suspend
receiving of supplies from the Azumacchi.

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:38.400
Why so suddenly?

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.730
Huh? The main force has
moved up their schedule?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.330
What? That thing is still out?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:57.080
We have a lot of other things to do!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.340
Oh, my.

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:02.420
Looks like Lieutenant Happa has fallen
in love with it all over again.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.300
What is this siren for?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:08.510
The space fleet will be going into sub-orbital
flight sooner than expected, right?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.890
We have to provide a diversion for them.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:13.680
What are these air balls for?

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.810
There's enough here for one cours in a nut.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:19.440
Oh, these are getting old, so I was
testing that they're still usable.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.980
You didn't steal them from the Crown then.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.690
- ﻿On this island—
- You can't come.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.360
Neither can you!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.860
Chuchumy.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:33.040
Pardon us. the Megafauna really
is part of the military, huh?

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.500
Well, how about it, will you
enlist in the Amerian Army?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.500
If you'll give me the rank
of Lieutenant, I'll do it.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.090
Then you would have the same rank as I do!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.050
I'm not keen on being bullied.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.770
We are tracing Captain Dellensen's course.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:59.350
Are there places you could
hide a ship around here?

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:00.810
Quite a few.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.280
Captain, what is going on?

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:09.740
When is the Megafauna scheduled
to engage in the decoy operation?

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.700
The schedule has been moved up.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:13.910
Chuchumy.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.500
Those kids trail behind
us like baby ducks.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.710
Just pretend they aren't there.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:24.130
This ship is presently moving
in response to unknown units.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.130
My lady, over here.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.630
Pardon me. Pardon me.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.470
How many unknowns are there?

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.140
About two teams, it looks like.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.520
They aren't from the Gondwan Army, correct?

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.730
This is the course the
Capital Army takes, isn't it?

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:42.940
Does the Capital Army have
this much fighting power?

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.150
That is something we ought to be asking you!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.360
Would you stop that!

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:50.660
If we take down those unknowns and
have the Megafauna act as a decoy,

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:54.120
we can carry out
Captain Cahill's plan, right?

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:58.040
With this ship's capabilities, after
we finish the decoy operation,

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.620
Captain Cahill's plan, which called for
the space fleet to occupy Capital Tower—

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.880
You're going to occupy Capital Tower?!

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:11.930
Must you ruin all of Captain Cahill's plans?!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.390
I'm sure I can never
apologize enough for that,

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.510
but I apologize.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:18.850
Just apologizing isn't enough!

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.810
I know it isn't a fair trade,
but I'll defend this ship in return.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.610
Lend me a pilot suit.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.820
How about it? Let's hear our genius
Lieutenant's opinion on the matter.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.150
Let us be patient with him.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.030
We need all the fighting strength
we can muster right now.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.030
Captain!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:38.580
He is a useful boy, my lady.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.960
Lieutenant, you handle this.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:41.910
Yes, Ma'am!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:42.920
Boy!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.550
I'm going to go get changed.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.230
F-Rugs against the Capital Army's
Doubey type and Catsiths?

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.570
I can't call this one.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.110
Guess we'll see what
Lieutenant Klim is capable of.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.830
Hatches are above the water line.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.790
- Opening them now.
- ﻿All fins spread.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.130
- Any transmissions from Mick Jack?
- ﻿She's cut off communication herself.

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:29.460
The Fry-Schops can contact
her for us at any time.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.010
That's fine.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:34.760
We're going to be taking down the unknowns
and launching the decoy operation.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.100
Lieutenant Klim, be prepared
to head out at any time.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.770
The Montero is ready.

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.310
To all Grimoires, we will be
engaging in mid-air combat.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.480
Do the rest yourself.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.690
O-Okay.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.650
Wow! It's a perfect fit!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.990
Adjusting the seat and this
attachment was a pain.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.360
Use that helmet.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.030
Thank you.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.080
Hey, when are we escaping in the G-Self?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:04.290
There's going to be a battle,
so we can't right now.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.790
I made a promise with the
people on this ship, you know?

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:09.540
You're still crushing on that woman.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:12.000
- Chuchumy too!
- ﻿Chuchumy can't wear one!

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.340
Raraiya came from Towasanga.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.850
How do you know that?

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.350
She's not surprised to
see these outfits at all.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:38.610
This is it.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:40.450
Curse that pirate ship.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.790
Are they planning to launch into space?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:49.330
All hands! Spreading fins!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.000
Proceed to Minovsky Flight.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.090
Hold it in place

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.600
- What are you doing?
- ﻿Can't you tell?

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.060
This is molded rubber
for use in space, right?

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:07.850
There are water balls in here!

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:08.810
Locked in!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.150
- Um, they told me to sortie.
- ﻿I know!

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.650
Check these on the control panel.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.030
Lower the crane!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:19.070
The hatch is opening! Grimoires to the front!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:21.780
Miss Aida will defend from the ship's deck.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:24.200
The Arcane can fly too, you know!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.250
I would rather you refrain from such jokes.

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.710
It has yet to be tested.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:04.050
There's heavy wind! Be careful!

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.540
The rear hatch is opening as well!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.790
- Have you figured it out?
- ﻿Yeah!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:14.130
The air and water ball systems
are intended for rescue use.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.420
They can also be used as propellant.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.670
Huh? Happa?

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.670
I'm checking the docking sensor.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:20.760
The Montero is heading out!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:40.650
My lady, you can hear us
by contact link, right?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.910
That anti-ship rifle is too much
for you to handle! Stop it!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.700
If I use the sight, I can manage.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.870
I won't let you keep me from fighting!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.370
Happa, I've matched up the sensors here.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.580
I won't rely on the help of others!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:58.460
Three of them!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:01.880
Take this!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.100
Machine guns, aim straight up!

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.020
The main force will come from below!

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:18.270
I will keep them in check here!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.570
It's just like the Lieutenant said!
They came from sea level!

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.620
Our timing may appear slow,

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.460
but our Catsith formation
isn't just for show!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.680
They got one of us!

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:46.550
What?!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:54.600
You would transform, and come at me unarmed?

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.900
Is this a game to you?!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.530
Why you

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.330
A direct hit on my rifle?!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.580
Now die,

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:14.960
space pirate!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:20.460
I still have a Javelin!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.720
Core! Core!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.930
Raraiya!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.310
Bell, what are you doing?!

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:34.730
Weren't you going to protect the Megafauna?!

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:38.440
Bellri Zenam!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.770
Attach that thing to the back of the G-Self!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.030
You can say that...

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:44.690
But this thing won't listen to me!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:47.410
Okay.

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:48.570
What?

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.250
I can't land a hit!

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:57.460
Send a request to Miss Aida by contact link.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:58.620
Sure!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.460
Miss Aida, you hear me?

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.840
Grab young Bellri and ram
him inside the G-Self!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.170
Huh? I can't do that!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.680
It's not possible.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.930
Don't get picky with me during battle!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:14.180
The Core Fighter is moving around on its own!

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:21.900
It flew off!

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.740
Huh?! That's Mr. Genius's Montero!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.080
Now I finish you from behind!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.370
I can't take steady aim!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.330
Wh-What?

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:44.000
You fool!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.590
Showing off the insides of your
machine will do us no good!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.470
Did the machine guns come out?

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.020
﻿The Schops that came in as
reinforcements are doing well.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.980
Gisela! Don't hold back on the anti-air fire!

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.610
Roger that.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:09.240
We have more work to do after this!
All gunners, drive off those pesky flies!

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.030
Hey, you shouldn't do that!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.740
We won't need bullets
for the decoy operation!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.990
This isn't good!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.210
My head!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.000
The water balls!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.600
What kind of attack is this?

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.220
Did I fall into the sea?

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.020
I-It's water!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.440
Bellri Zenam, come back here and dock!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:50.860
Boy, the Megafauna has
the G-Self out! Turn back!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.570
Even if they have it out,

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:58.240
you expect me to weave through
anti-air fire to get there?

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.210
He can't do it like this!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.210
What? That kid plans to go through with it?!

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.970
What? Autopilot?!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:18.560
Why?! I'm gonna crash!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.020
I'm in!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.400
Connect electric system

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.570
Okay, I think I can do this!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.450
Get up there and take them down!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.070
What am I supposed to do without a backpack?

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:38.580
Attack once, then withdraw!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:40.660
You can fly for 45 seconds!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.670
Then move aside! I can't see a thing!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.290
S-Sorry.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.170
So you've come!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.420
I won't let pirates have the G-Self!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.140
The Montero got decapitated

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:57.890
Some genius pilot!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.140
He flew!

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.390
45 seconds!

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:08.150
You dare resist me?!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.160
He's turned his beam saber
into a net to block it!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:25.580
I can't win by just defending!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:27.960
What?!

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:31.550
The Capital Army mustn't use such things!

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:38.260
That beam... did it stretch?

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:43.140
Colonel Cumpa Rusita said
nothing about such an ability!

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:45.890
I have the data from this battle!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.150
I-I'm a goner.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:00.370
Use the nozzles on the waist
and knees to slow our descent!

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:01.660
L-Like this?

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.210
Reinforcements are coming.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.630
Hang in there.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.630
The Megafauna has another
operation after this.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.670
That's ridiculous!

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:18.630
The Arcane came for us!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.140
The G-Self is inside.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.310
so hurry up and shut the main gate!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.150
Listen, we have our own arrangements to make!

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:31.020
All hands, we'll be going into
sub-orbital spaceflight after this!

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.650
What are you trying to say?

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.440
I intend to thank him myself as well,

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:37.950
We need to check that all sections are airtight!

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:40.160
but please, Miss Aida,
praise Bellri Zenam.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.720
It may be sub-orbital flight, but we'll still be in space!

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.830
That, Miss Aida, is your job.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.120
It may be your obligation.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.210
My obligation?

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:52.920
Because you are the one who
will become the Princess.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.800
Air density, 0.005.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.170
Air density is thin! Thin!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.720
That's enough!

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.840
Chuchumy says welcome home.

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:04.350
It looks like you're getting better, Raraiya.

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.060
- Chuchumy.
- She is.

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:09.560
It seems this view puts her at ease.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.480
She must be used to this sort of thing.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.980
He did worse than I expected.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:16.230
He did manage to come back without the head,

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.070
maybe he really is a genius.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.950
We have the parts!

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:22.490
We can't just plug them in!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.450
It's your job to make it work regardless!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.740
The enemy's new models... amazing.

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.580
I really must thank you!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:32.710
No, you were the one who saved us.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:36.340
I thank you on behalf of all
the crew of the Megafauna.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:40.840
We don't want to die either,
so let's call it even.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.590
Even? I guess so.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.300
Hey, kid.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:48.720
If you will join as a second lieutenant,
I could recommend you for the Amerian Army.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.390
I have to be a lieutenant
or it's not happening.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:55.110
Then it will be after I
become a captain. My lady.

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:56.650
- All hands!
- ﻿Chuchumy.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.110
This ship will now enter
sub-orbital spaceflight.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:01.820
All sections check for air leaks.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:04.490
It is possible we will need
to launch Mobile Suits again.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:08.870
Hurry with the docking adjustments on the
Fry-Schops fixed to the outside of the ship.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:13.000
Cahill, forgive me.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.250
Cahill, I'm sorry.

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.340
I had no choice...

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:22.050
but to thank a pilot who was your enemy.

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:24.890
I can't stand it!

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:27.430
Cahill!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.180
We still have things to tie down!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:33.060
That hurts!

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:36.560
Upper hangar, the G-Self's
backpack is moving.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.070
Don't hit it with anything!

00:21:38.070 --> 00:21:40.900
We're gonna escape when there's an
opportunity during battle, right?

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.780
That's why I told you to wear space suits.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.450
We can do that. Right?

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.500
I have a duty as a Capital Guard cadet
that I need to accomplish.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:54.120
We've been spying on this ship too.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.960
That's not all.

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:59.040
That thing is going to be mine!

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:08.010
Fry-Schop landing confirmed.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:12.560
All right, switch from Minovsky
flight to sub-orbital spaceflight.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:04.840
I planned to escape from
the Megafauna with Noredo,

00:24:04.840 --> 00:24:07.800
but when the Capital Army attacks from above

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.170
they believe the G-Self is their enemy.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:12.300
Without time to correct
that misunderstanding,

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:15.640
I make the biggest mistake of my life.

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:19.390
On the next episode of Reconguista in G,

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:20.980
Dellensen, a Fearsome Foe!

00:24:21.440 --> 00:24:24.310
If it's too thrilling for you,
you don't have to watch!
